        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, passenger car
For the disposal of steel, aluminium and cooper and tyres a cut off allocation is applied. ;
UUID: adec71af-053d-469e-9792-0761162fdff5
The inventory includes disposal processes for bulk materials. For the disposal of tyres a cut off allocation is applied. However, the transportation of tyres to the cement works is taken into account
Location: Data represents Swiss conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents future conditions, since the new Golf A4 is not frequently disposed in 2000.
Production volume: na
Sampling: data is based on the material consumption of vehicles. For the transportation of used tyres an expert estimate is used. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_adec71af-053d-469e-9792-0761162fdff5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
